# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says on the
# machine. Without this the repo held both: twelve files had been committed with CRLF and
# the rest with LF, so a tool that wrote a file back with the other ending made every
# line of it show as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.xcf binary
